msgctxt "9140"
msgid "Batting Center: Hard Game"
msgstr "Centro de bateo: Juego dificil"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9144"
msgid "Player"
msgstr "Player"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Kiryu"
msgid "(Sure, I'll do it for Haruka...)"
msgstr "(Claro, lo haré por Haruka...)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "368_Haruka"
msgid "Uncle Kaz! Get at least 2,600 points in a Hard Game!"
msgstr "¡Tío Kaz! ¡Tienes que alcanzar 2600 puntos en una partida difícil!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "380_Kiryu"
msgid "(At least 2,600 points in a Hard Game... One play is 300 yen. Should I give it a try?)"
msgstr "(Tengo que alcanzar 2600 puntos en una partida difícil... Son 300 yenes. ¿Debería jugar?)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Kiryu"
msgid "(Okay, let's do this.)"
msgstr "(Está bien, lo intentaré.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Haruka"
msgid "Good luck, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr "¡Buena suerte, Tío Kaz!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "428_Kiryu"
msgid "(Not right now.)"
msgstr "(Ahora no)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "440_Haruka"
msgid "Aww, I wanted to see you play, though..."
msgstr "Awwh, quería verte jugar..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "452_Kiryu"
msgid "(Wish I could play a Hard Game, but I don't have the cash... It shouldn't be too hard to find 300 yen.)"
msgstr "(Quiero jugar una partida difícil, pero no tengo dinero... No debería ser difícil conseguir 300 yenes.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "464_Haruka"
msgid "Aww! You should play!"
msgstr "¡Deberías jugar!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "476_Kiryu"
msgid "Press <Action:Button_Cross@Battingcenter> at the right time to hit the balls pitched by the pitching machine. Hit the numbered targets to earn points."
msgstr "Presiona <Action:Button_Cross@Battingcenter> al mismo tiempo que golpeas la pelota que viene de la máquina. Golpea los numerosos objetivos y gana puntos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "488_Kiryu"
msgid "There are nine targets in the Hard Game. Once a target is hit, it will not be restored until all the remaining targets are also hit."
msgstr "Son nueve objetivos en una partida difícil. Una vez el objetivo es golpeado, este no será restaurado hasta que los demás también sean golpeados."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "500_Kiryu"
msgid "Use <Action:Button_LS_Up@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Down@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Left@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Right@Battingcenter> to aim your shot. If you aim well enough, you can hit three targets at once and earn three times the points. However, the target in the center cannot be hit as part of a multiple shot."
msgstr "Usa <Action:Button_LS_Up@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Down@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Left@Battingcenter><Action:Button_LS_Right@Battingcenter> para apuntar. Si tienes buena puntería, puedes golpear tres objetivos a la vez y ganar tres puntos. Igualmente, el objetivo en el centro no puede ser parte del golpe múltiple."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "512_Kiryu"
msgid "In the hard course, hit targets down, across, or diagonally to score points. You can get bonus points by hitting multiple targets at once. Think carefully about the order in which to hit the targets."
msgstr "En una partida difícil, los objetivos se mueven de abajo, a lo ancho y diagonalmente. Puedes ganar más puntos si das varios al mismo tiempo. Piensa con cuidado el orden de cuál golpear."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "524_Kiryu"
msgid "Once you hit all the targets, a bonus target will appear. However, you only get one chance to hit it. The bonus target disappears after one pitch, whether you hit it or not. Aim carefully and go for a new high score!"
msgstr "Una vez que terminaste con todos, un objetivo extra aparecerá. Solo tienes una chance. El objetivo extra desaparecerá una vez salga la bola, tanto si le das como si no. ¡Apunta cuidadosamente y ve por ese nuevo récord!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "572_Player"
msgid "(Hmm... The Hard Game is 300 yen. Maybe I should give it a try.)"
msgstr "(300 yenes... una partida difícil. Debería darle una oportunidad)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "584_Player"
